      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتَذَامٌ</span></b> , [accord. to some, seems to signify
The <i>cutting off</i> a thing <i>for oneself:</i>] accord. to
some, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِيبُ النَّفْسِ</span> [as meaning the <i>being pleased,
content,</i> or <i>willing:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَذِمٌ</span>]. (Ham p. 703,
q. v.)

